le of Lot denied the warning.","j":27,"h":53,"s":54,"a":33,"sd":null},{"k":"54:34","t":"Indeed, We sent upon them a storm of stones, except the family of Lot - We saved them before dawn.","j":27,"h":53,"s":54,"a":34,"sd":null},{"k":"54:35","t":"As favor from Us. Thus do We reward he who is grateful.","j":27,"h":53,"s":54,"a":35,"sd":null},{"k":"54:36","t":"And he had already warned them of Our assault, but they disputed the warning.","j":27,"h":53,"s":54,"a":36,"sd":null},{"k":"54:37","t":"And they had demanded from him his guests, but We obliterated their eyes, [saying], \"Taste My punishment and warning.\"","j":27,"h":53,"s":54,"a":37,"sd":null},{"k":"54:38","t":"And there came upon them by morning an abiding punishment.","j":27,"h":53,"s":54,"a":38,"sd":null},{"k":"54:39","t":"So taste My punishment and warning.","j":27,"h":53,"s":54,"a":39,"sd":null},{"k":"54:40","t":"And We have certainly made the Qur’ān easy for remembrance, so is there any who will remember?","j":27,"h":53,"s":54,"a":40,"sd":null},{"k":"54:41","t":"And there certainly came to the people of Pharaoh warning.","j":27,"h":53,"s":54,"a":41,"sd":null},{"k":"54:42","t":"They denied Our signs, all of them, so We seized them with a seizure of one Exalted in Might and Perfect in Ability.","j":27,"h":53,"s":54,"a":42,"sd":null},{"k":"54:43","t":"Are your disbelievers better than those [former ones], or have you immunity in the scriptures?","j":27,"h":53,"s":54,"a":43,"sd":null},{"k":"54:44","t":"Or do they say, \"We are an assembly supporting [each other]\"?","j":27,"h":53,"s":54,"a":44,"sd":null},{"k":"54:45","t":"[Their] assembly will be defeated, and they will turn their backs [in retreat].","j":27,"h":53,"s":54,"a":45,"sd":null},{"k":"54:46","t":"But the Hour is their appointment [for due punishment], and the Hour is more disastrous and more bitter.","j":27,"h":53,"s":54,"a":46,"sd":null},{"k":"54:47","t":"Indeed, the criminals are in error and madness..","j":27,"h":53,"s":54,"a":47,"sd":null},{"k":"54:48","t":"The Day they are dragged into the Fire on their faces [it will be said], \"Taste the touch of Saqar.\"","j":27,"h":53,"s":54,"a":48,"sd":null},{"k":"54:49","t":"Indeed, all things We created with predestination.","j":27,"h":53,"s":54,"a":49,"sd":null}],"juz":27,"hizb":53,"surahs":[54],"sajdah":false}